OL,3,GNEWSA'Vile' paedophile jailed for
OL,4,Araping young girls
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "vile" paedophile who raped and
OL,7,Fsexually assaulted a number of children
OL,8,Fhas been jailed for more than 30 years.
OL,10,FTimothy Mealing, of no fixed address,
OL,11,Fwas convicted of 24 sexual offences
OL,12,Fagainst four girls including five
OL,13,Fcounts of raping a child under 13.
OL,15,FMealing, 34, had pleaded guilty to
OL,16,Foffences against two survivors but
OL,17,Fdenied those against two others.
OL,18,FFollowing a trial in September at
OL,19,FBristol Crown Court, a jury unanimously
OL,20,Ffound him guilty of the remaining
OL,21,Foffences.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
