OL,3,GNEWSA'Vile' paedophile jailed for
OL,4,Araping young girls
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of his victims said he had caused
OL,7,Fher a "lifetime of trauma", while Det
OL,8,FCon Emma Parry said the "vile man
OL,9,Fpreyed on very young girls in the most
OL,10,Fdespicable way imaginable".
